  "details": "- Rebase onto the vendor 1.12.9-4.el9_8.6 sources, which avoid path traversal deletion via deploy export/bin (CVE-2026-97023) and use fd-relative operations for files/etc during runtime deploy (CVE-2026-97024)\n- Retained the TuxCare hardening of regenerate_ld_cache() in common/flatpak-run.c and of flatpak_switch_symlink_and_remove() in common/flatpak-utils.c, which the vendor sources still lack\n- Retained the retry of openat2() on EAGAIN in libglnx glnx_chaseat(), which the vendor's chase patches leave out",
